      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T08:52:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e The REST API endpoints available in replicas is a subset of the ones available in primary Gerrits.\n\nAFAIK, replicas have NO REST-API exposed.\n\nTry to run a Gerrit server as a replica and use the most basic REST API, such as `/config/server/version`, and you\u0027ll get a 404.",
      "parentUuid": "1ac3392e_19b29332",
